#. module: sale_subscription
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/sale_subscription/models/sale_order.py:0
msgid ""
"\n"
"- You are trying to invoice recurring orders. Please verify the delivered "
"quantity of product based on invoicing policy, next invoice date and end "
"date of the contract."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"- Je probeert terugkerende orders (abonnementen) te factureren. Controleer "
"het geleverde aantal van het product op basis van het factureringsbeleid, de "
"volgende factuurdatum en de einddatum van het contract."

#. module: sale_subscription
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_sale_subscription
