#: model:ir.model.fields,help:sale_subscription.field_account_move_line__subscription_mrr
msgid ""
"The MRR is computed by dividing the signed amount (in company currency) by "
"the amount of time between the start and end dates converted in months.\n"
"This allows comparison of invoice lines created by subscriptions with "
"different temporalities.\n"
"The computation assumes that 1 month is comprised of exactly 30 days, "
"regardless  of the actual length of the month."
msgstr ""
"De MRR wordt berekend door het ondertekende bedrag (in bedrijfsvaluta) te "
"delen door de tijd tussen de begin- en einddatum, omgerekend in maanden.\n"
